# Settings for examples/systemd/ggrun.service (~/.config/ggrun/service.env).
GGRUN_MODEL=/home/you/ai_models/your-model.gguf
# Optional ggrun flags, space separated. A service has no terminal, so a plan
# that needs weights paged from disk must be allowed explicitly with --mmap.
GGRUN_ARGS=--port 8081
